    skos:definition "Formal urban settlements with a population of between 1,000,000 and 10,000,000 inhabitants, characterised by complex governance structures, significant economic output, and high population density." ;
    skos:inScheme <https://vocab.destiny-evidence.org/human-settlements> ;
