    skos:inScheme <https://vocab.destiny-evidence.org/interventions-responses-solutions> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Civic engagement" .

<https://vocab.destiny-evidence.org/interventions-responses-solutions/DSNY000101> a skos:Concept ;
