    skos:definition "Changes to daily routines, work patterns, or living arrangements made within a person's current location in response to changing conditions, without relocating." ;
    skos:inScheme <https://vocab.destiny-evidence.org/interventions-responses-solutions> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Lifestyle change in place" .

<https://vocab.destiny-evidence.org/interventions-responses-solutions/DSNY000105> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:altLabel "Climate migration",
        "Displacement",
        "Relocation" ;
    skos:broader <https://vocab.destiny-evidence.org/interventions-responses-solutions/DSNY000098> ;
    skos:definition "Movement of individuals or communities away from areas made uninhabitable or highly hazardous by climate change, including both voluntary relocation and forced displacement." ;
    skos:inScheme <https://vocab.destiny-evidence.org/interventions-responses-solutions> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Migration" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Refers to migration as a deliberate adaptive behaviour in response to climate hazards — the act of relocating as a coping or protective strategy. Distinct from 'Migrants' in the Population scheme, which classifies people who have migrated as a potentially vulnerable population group." .

<https://vocab.destiny-evidence.org/interventions-responses-solutions/DSNY000106> a skos:Concept ;
